//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Kassahi luxe — full alias set (consolidated)
//
// Merged from the legacy two-file layout:
//   * `03-alias-kassahi-general-luxe` (GEN_*, BOSS_*, RUNE_*, MAG_*, RARE_*,
//     UNI_*, SET_*, FACET_*, RW_BASE_*, CRAFT_*, etc. — visuals shared by this
//     variant's family)
//   * `03-alias-kassahi-luxe` (GG_* item-specific aliases, MAIN_DOT,
//     PD2_MATS, plus the rvl rename and gem name re-formatting)
//-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// === Set 2: shared visual-family aliases (general) ===

// General item
Alias[GEN_ITEM]: %BLACK%@%PURPLE%@%GREEN%@%BLACK%@ %NAME% %BLACK%@%GREEN%@%PURPLE%@%BLACK%@

// General item Alt
